        "DAG_Scheduler.decompose_goal() → task_dag",
        "DAG_Scheduler.assign_worker() → assignment",
        "Safety_Shield.check_circuit_breaker() → safe_bool",
        "Safety_Shield.enforce_guardrails() → allowed_bool"
      ],
      "relevant_decisions": [
        "D1: Python骨架+LLM决策混合架构 — Python提供确定性骨架(状态管理/锁/IO)，所有控制流决策由LLM执行",
        "D4: 简单优先级队列+拓扑排序 — Loop引擎通过DAG调度器实现任务排序"
      ],
      "relevant_risks": [
        "R10: 上下文丢失 — 分层记忆+偏离检测，下一checkpoint恢复"
